\f2\b \cf6 \cb7 Preventing Race Conditions
\f0\b0 \cf0 \cb1 \cell 
\pard\intbl\itap1\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf6 \cb7 Relied on a manually managed\'a0
\f4\fs26 \cb8 searchId
\f0\fs28 \cb7 \'a0that was passed through 4-5 different functions and checked at every step. This was error-prone and verbose.\cf0 \cb1 \cell 
\pard\intbl\itap1\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf6 \cb7 Relied on a simple\'a0
\f4\fs26 \cb8 clearTimeout()
\f0\fs28 \cb7 \'a0call. This is a standard, robust, and concise way to ensure only the latest action executes.\cf0 \cb1 \cell \row

\itap1\trowd \taflags0 \trgaph108\trleft-108 \trbrdrl\brdrnil \trbrdrr\brdrnil 
