\f0\b0 \cf0 \cb1 \cell 
\pard\intbl\itap1\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0

\f4\fs26 \cf6 \cb8 filteredLocations
\f0\fs28 \cb7 \'a0was calculated once and passed through the entire asynchronous chain, becoming "stale" and causing the bug.\cf0 \cb1 \cell 
