\f0\fs28 \cb7 \'a0is calculated immediately for the UI, and then\'a0
\f2\b re-calculated
\f0\b0 \'a0with fresh data from the search bar right before the zoom begins. No stale data is ever used.\cf0 \cb1 \cell \row

